# uav_ulsan (울산동구UAV) - 프로젝트별 설정
# [dev] 개발 / [demo] 시연 / [prod] 운영

[dev]
DATABASE_HOST=192.168.127.32
DATABASE_PORT=5433
DATABASE_NAME=uav_ulsan
DATABASE_USER=uav_ulsan
DATABASE_PASSWORD=uav_ulsan
GGNR_PIPELINE_PYTHON=python/env/python.exe
GGNR_DATA_DIR=g:\ggnr_data_dir\uav_ulsan
DISABLE_USE_FEE_SYNC_SCHEDULER=1

[demo]
DATABASE_HOST=192.168.126.60
DATABASE_PORT=5433
DATABASE_NAME=uav_ulsan
DATABASE_USER=uav_ulsan
DATABASE_PASSWORD=uav_ulsan
GGNR_PIPELINE_PYTHON=python/env/python.exe
GGNR_DATA_DIR=\\192.168.127.11\service_data\ggnr_data_dir\uav_ulsan
VWORLD_API_KEY=
# 게이트 https://dggs.kr/uav_ulsan → Next basePath (빌드·기동 시 동일 값 필요)
BASE_PATH=/uav_ulsan

[prod]
DATABASE_HOST=
DATABASE_PORT=5432
DATABASE_NAME=
DATABASE_USER=
DATABASE_PASSWORD=
GGNR_PIPELINE_PYTHON=
GGNR_DATA_DIR=
VWORLD_API_KEY=
# BASE_PATH=uav_ulsan

